{"id":"secreto","lemma":"secreto","pos":"noun","rank":493,"glosses":["a secret","secrecy"],"ipa":"/seˈkɾeto/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"secretos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/86/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-secreto.wav","examples":[{"text":"No es ningún secreto.","en":"It's no secret.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/440985"},{"text":"Ella guarda los secretos.","en":"She keeps secrets.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/444325"},{"text":"Él lo mantuvo secreto.","en":"He kept it secret.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/519278"},{"text":"Nosotros no teníamos secretos.","en":"We had no secrets.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/448250"},{"text":"Él guardó el secreto.","en":"He kept it secret.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/524369"}]}